  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">PIMS 10287- Renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s nationales pour la mise en &#x153;uvre de la CDN 3.0 en R&#xe9;publique du Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">One of the most important barriers for the effective implementation of the NDC and climate policy in RoC is limited access to climate finance. For example, climate finance needs to the effective implementation of RoC&#x2019;s NDC 2.0 are estimated at 8,190.15 million USD by 2030, and the implementation of the NDC 3.0, currently under development, expected with higher ambition will require more resources According to OECD (2023), climate finance mobilized by RoC was only 440 million USD between 2002-202</narrative>
  </description>
